<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria HI grp oper profit up.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria HI grp oper profit up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First six months of the year to</p>
<p>June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>							1997	 1996</p>
<p> Group operating profit			7.117	5.671</p>
<p> Group operating income		     21.499     19.019</p>
<p> Group operating expenses		   14.382     13.348</p>
<p>NOTES - Bank Austria will hold a news conference on its first half earnings at 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>Group figures are consolidated to include Creditanstalt, which Bank Austria acquired at the start of the year  </p>
<p> Group commission income		     4.325	3.906</p>
<p> Group trading income			  2.727	1.547</p>
<p> Group personnel expenses		    8.201	7.641</p>
<p> Group depreciation			    1.004	0.803</p>
<p> Balance sheet			     1,574.314  1,440.991</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
